      "question_type": "solution",
      "choice_mode": "",
      "section_heading_before": "",
      "question_markdown": "15. (本小题满分 13 分) 已知集合 $A=\\left\\{x \\mid \\frac{2-x}{x+2}>0\\right\\}$，$B=\\{x \\mid |x-1|>2\\}$，$C=\\{x \\mid m-1<x<2m+1\\}$。\n(1) 求 $A \\cap B$，$(\\complement_R B) \\cup A$；\n(2) 若 $A \\cap C=C$，求实数 $m$ 的取值范围。",
      "question_review": {
        "status": "reviewed_via_api2_atomic_patch",
        "source_context_ids": [
          "C001"
        ],
        "recognition_profile_version": "symbol_profile_v3",
        "symbol_audit_target_count": 0,
        "symbol_audit_observed_count": 0,
        "figure_audit_version": "figure_audit_v1",
        "figure_audit_target_count": 0,
        "figure_audit_observed_count": 0,
        "figure_observations": [],
        "lint_actions": [
          "applied_solution_edit_1_ocr_correction"
        ],
        "context_manifest": "/home/puppeteer/MathOCRClaw/benchmark/test_runs/04-api2-triple-average/qwen3.7-plus/workflow/page25/code_outputs/match/question_contexts.json"
      },
      "handwritten_answer": {
        "text": "解：$A=\\{x \\mid \\frac{2-x}{x+2}>0\\}$\n$\\therefore A=\\{x \\mid -2<x<2\\}$\n$B=\\{x \\mid |x-1|>2\\}$\n$\\therefore B=\\{x \\mid x<-1 \\text{或} x>3\\}$\n$\\therefore A \\cap B=\\{x \\mid -2<x<-1\\}$\n$(\\complement_R B)=\\{x \\mid -1 \\le x \\le 3\\}$\n$(\\complement_R B) \\cup A=\\{x \\mid -2<x \\le 3\\}$\n(2) $\\because A \\cap C=C$\n$\\therefore C \\subseteq A$",
        "answer_parts": [],
