        ],
        "context_manifest": "/home/puppeteer/MathOCRClaw/benchmark/test_runs/04-api2-triple-average/qwen3.7-plus/workflow/page25/code_outputs/match/question_contexts.json"
      },
      "handwritten_answer": {
        "text": "解：(1) $\\because 0<x<2$\n$\\therefore 0<2x<4$\n$\\because 0<y<3$\n$\\therefore -3<-y<0$\n$\\therefore -3<2x-y<4$\n(2) $\\because x>3$\n$\\therefore x-3>0$\n$\\therefore 2x-6>0$\n$y=2x+\\frac{4}{2x-6}=2x-6+\\frac{4}{2x-6}+6$\n$\\ge 2\\sqrt{(2x-6) \\cdot \\frac{4}{2x-6}}+6=10$\n当且仅当 $2x-6=\\frac{4}{2x-6}$ 时，等号可取\n$\\therefore (2x+\\frac{4}{2x-6})_{\\min}=10$\n(3) $y: 0<x<4$\n$\\therefore 4-x>0$\n$8-2x>0$\n$x(8-2x)=\\frac{1}{2} \\cdot 2x(8-2x)$\n$\\le \\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\frac{2x+8-2x}{2}\\right)^2=8$\n$\\therefore x(8-2x) \\le 8$\n$x(8-2x)_{\\max}=8$",
